    "sections": {
        "description": "Online Toys Shop Theme provides a structured layout for presenting toy products, categories, promotional sections, and essential store information. Its responsive design adapts the storefront to desktop, tablet, and mobile screen sizes, helping maintain consistent content presentation across devices. Product listings can display images, prices, descriptions, and other relevant details in an organized format. Category sections help separate different types of products and make store navigation easier. The Online Toys Shop theme supports eCommerce functionality for displaying products and managing common shopping elements such as product pages, carts, and checkout sections. Customization options allow adjustments to colors, typography, layouts, and other visual settings without changing the core structure. Homepage sections can be arranged to highlight selected products, featured categories, offers, or informational content. Clean navigation, readable content areas, and mobile-friendly layouts provide a straightforward browsing experience. Integration with commonly used plugins can further extend store functionality where required."
    },
